#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""CGC Qwen3-VL dense resume patch (sglang-native, auto-generated by cgc_engine).

由 cgc_engine 自动化框架生成 (step2 AST 提取 qwen3_vl.py 指纹 + step5 按
DOPDResumePayloadV2 state ABI 模板渲染)。把 qwen3_resume_patch.py 的 CGC_RESUME_FROM
resume 机制适配到 Qwen3-VL dense (Qwen3LLMModel),让云端 sglang server 能从
Mac emit 的 hidden_P resume forward 后 L-P 层 (layer-split 反向 Mac→cloud)。

与 qwen3_vl_moe_resume_patch.py (MoE 版) 共享同一 state ABI (DOPDResumePayloadV2),
差异收敛进 abi_descriptor["model_type"] 字段 (dense vs moe)。自动化 agent 框架
step2 AST 通过类名 (Qwen3LLMModel vs Qwen3MoeLLMModel) 和基类 (Qwen3Model vs
Qwen3MoeModel) 自动区分 dense/MoE,step5 模板渲染对应 patch。

设计 (Design) — dense vs MoE 的 AST 差异 (state ABI 收敛点)
==========================================================
通过 SSH 读取云端 qwen3_vl.py (dense) 与 qwen3_vl_moe.py (MoE) 的 AST 对比:

  维度                    | dense (qwen3_vl.py)              | MoE (qwen3_vl_moe.py)
  ------------------------|----------------------------------|---------------------------
  类层级                  | Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration  | Qwen3VLMoeForConditionalGeneration
                          |  → self.model = Qwen3LLMModel    |  → self.model = Qwen3MoeLLMModel
                          |     (继承 Qwen3Model,            |     (继承 Qwen3MoeModel,
                          |      from sglang.srt.models      |      有 router/gate/expert)
                          |      .qwen3 import Qwen3Model)   |
  resume 派发点            | Qwen3LLMModel.forward (LLM 层)   | Qwen3MoeLLMModel.forward (LLM 层)
  forward 签名            | (input_ids, positions,           | (input_ids, positions,
                          |  forward_batch, input_embeds,   |  forward_batch, input_embeds,
                          |  pp_proxy_tensors,               |  pp_proxy_tensors,
                          |  input_deepstack_embeds)         |  input_deepstack_embeds)
                          |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑              |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑
  层调用                  | layer(positions, hs, fb,         | layer(positions, hs, fb,
                          |   residual,                      |   residual,
                          |   post_residual_addition=        |   post_residual_addition=
                          |   deepstack_embeds)              |   deepstack_embeds)
                          |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑              |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑
  norm 调用               | norm(hs, residual,               | norm(hs, residual,
                          |  post_residual_addition=         |  post_residual_addition=
                          |  last_deepstack)                |  last_deepstack)
                          |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑              |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑
  DecoderLayer 内部        | Qwen3DecoderLayer (无 router)   | Qwen3MoeDecoderLayer (有
                          |                                  |  router/gate/expert/MoE)
  MoE router 状态暴露      | 无 (纯 dense FFN)                | 有 (router logits, expert
                          |                                  |  routing 决策)
  residual 格式            | (hidden_states, residual) tuple  | (hidden_states, residual) tuple
                          |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑              |        ↑ 完全一致 ↑

关键结论 (state ABI 收敛):
  - 在 LLMModel.forward 视角下, dense 与 MoE 的 AST 完全一致:
    forward 签名、层调用、norm 调用、pp_group 处理、deepstack 逻辑全部相同
  - MoE 的 router/gate/expert 状态完全收敛在 DecoderLayer 内部,
    不暴露到 LLMModel.forward 层,故不影响 resume 的 state ABI
  - resume 切点 (cut layer P) 语义统一: Mac 跑 0..P-1, cloud 跑 P..end
  - residual 格式统一: 都是 (hidden_states, residual) tuple, pp_proxy_tensors
    都用 {"hidden_states", "residual"} 两个 key
  - 唯一差异: DecoderLayer 内部实现 (dense FFN vs MoE router), 但这对 resume
    consumer 透明 (consumer 只注入 hidden_states + residual, 不关心层内部)
  - 因此 DOPDResumePayloadV2 可统一 dense + MoE, 用 abi_descriptor["model_type"]
    字段标注 "dense" | "moe", abi_descriptor["has_moe_router"] bool 辅助

VL 特有 (与 qwen3_resume_patch.py 非 VL 版差异)
  - VL wrapper.forward 不直接调 language_model.forward, 而是通过
    general_mm_embed_routine(language_model=self.model, ...) 间接调用
  - 故 resume 派发点必须下沉到 Qwen3LLMModel.forward (LLM 层),
    不能在 VL wrapper 层注入 (否则 general_mm_embed_routine 不透传参数)
  - 保留 input_deepstack_embeds + post_residual_addition (deepstack 行为)

state ABI (DOPDResumePayloadV2) — dense + MoE 统一
  - cgc_engine/pd/dopd_schema.py 的 DOPDResumePayloadV2 dataclass
  - 字段: session_id, handoff_id, phase_role, cache_schema, kv_variant (required)
         abi_descriptor: Dict (state ABI 描述, 含 model_type/finished_layer/
                            residual_ref/has_moe_router 等)
         resume_position (对应 finished_layer)
         transport_codec (default "cq4")
         state_bytes_b64 (hidden_states 序列化字节)
  - dense 与 MoE 共用同一 schema, 差异只在 abi_descriptor["model_type"]
  - abi_descriptor 字段:
      model_type: "dense" | "moe"   (本 patch 用 "dense")
      finished_layer: int           (Mac 已完成的最后一层 idx)
      residual_ref: Any            (residual tensor 或其引用)
      has_moe_router: bool          (dense=False, MoE=True)
      step: int                     (decode step counter)
  - 本 patch 双格式兼容:
      (a) DOPDResumePayloadV2 magic bytes -> decode_dopd_resume_payload_v2 ->
          读 abi_descriptor["finished_layer"] / abi_descriptor["residual_ref"]
      (b) 简单 dict {finished_layer, hidden_states, residual, step}
          (向后兼容 qwen3_resume_patch.py 的 MacEmitHandoff 协议)

非 resume 路径 (CGC_RESUME_FROM 未设) 完整委托原 Qwen3LLMModel.forward, 零侵入。

transport
  - CGC_TRANSPORT=mac_emit (默认): cloud MacEmitHandoff(role=receiver) TCP server
    监听 CGC_MAC_EMIT_PORT+rank, Mac emitter PUT push, cloud recv() pop
  - CGC_TRANSPORT=file: 测试用, torch.load {CGC_HANDOFF_PATH}.rank{r}.step{s}

用法 (Usage)
   apply :  python3 qwen3_vl_resume_patch.py --target <qwen3_vl.py>
   revert:  python3 qwen3_vl_resume_patch.py --target <qwen3_vl.py> --revert

   默认 target = /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/sglang/srt/models/qwen3_vl.py

环境变量 (Env, 云端 sglang server)
   CGC_RESUME_FROM=P           从第 P 层 resume (Mac 已跑 0..P-1)
   CGC_TRANSPORT=mac_emit      transport 模式 (默认) | file
   CGC_MAC_EMIT_PORT=31010     receiver 监听 port (base, +rank)
   CGC_RESUME_TIMEOUT=120.0    recv 超时秒
   CGC_HANDOFF_PATH            file 模式路径前缀

依赖: cgc_handoff_transport.py 须在 qwen3_vl.py 同目录或 sys.path
      (sglang 已 ship 在 srt/models/ 目录, cgc_engine 也在 /root/flashkv0516/cgc_engine/)
"""

